    "reason": "[ev-585616b932d5] and the CRD diffs [ev-efc5158ff817] and [ev-9beeb11a214a] only show that a new optional spec.refreshPolicy field (CreatedOnce, Periodic, OnChange) was added. The proposed exposure, \"an ExternalSecret with refreshPolicy unset\", has the shape used for a changed default. It would flag every existing ExternalSecret, but nothing shows that those resources behave differently after the upgrade. The schema excerpts are cut off before any default value, and no text says how the controller treats an unset refreshPolicy. To confirm or correct this condition I would need the CRD default for refreshPolicy, or an upgrade note on how existing ExternalSecrets are synced when it is unset.",
